# Store text files with LF line endings in git, whatever OS edits them.
# HCP Terraform and GitHub Actions run on Linux, and this stops the
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings and noisy whole-file diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
tfplan binary
